"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Iran is in talks with Oman about access to the Strait of Hormuz, even though it denies having discussions with the US. Both countries have said they might work together in the future.\",            \"english_title\": \"Iran and Oman Talks\",            \"translated_version\": \"Ir\u00e1n est\u00e1 hablando con Om\u00e1n sobre el acceso al Estrecho de Ormuz, aunque dice que no habla con Estados Unidos. Ambos pa\u00edses dicen que podr\u00edan trabajar juntos en el futuro.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ir\u00e1n y Om\u00e1n Hablan\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The BBC has gained access to Rawalakot, a place in Pakistan-administered Kashmir where there have been violent clashes between security forces and protesters.\",            \"english_title\": \"BBC in Rawalakot\",            \"translated_version\": \"La BBC ha llegado a Rawalakot, un lugar en Cachemira administrada por Pakist\u00e1n donde ha habido peleas violentas entre fuerzas de seguridad y manifestantes.\",            \"translated_title\": \"BBC en Rawalakot\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Photos released by Myanmar's military government show Suu Kyi meeting with an official from the International Committee of the Red Cross.\",            \"english_title\": \"Suu Kyi Meeting\",            \"translated_version\": \"Fotos del gobierno militar de Myanmar muestran a Suu Kyi reuni\u00e9ndose con un oficial del Comit\u00e9 Internacional de la Cruz Roja.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Reuni\u00f3n de Suu Kyi\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Since mid-July, Ukraine has been attacking Wildberries sites, claiming they help supply Russia's military.\",            \"english_title\": \"Ukraine Attacks Wildberries\",            \"translated_version\": \"Desde mediados de julio, Ucrania ha estado atacando sitios de Wildberries, diciendo que ayudan a suministrar al ej\u00e9rcito de Rusia.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ucrania Ataca Wildberries\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A high-profile case in Malaysia has shocked the nation and started a debate about how social media affects children.\",            \"english_title\": \"Malaysia Case Debate\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un caso importante en Malasia ha sorprendido a la naci\u00f3n y ha comenzado un debate sobre c\u00f3mo las redes sociales afectan a los ni\u00f1os.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Debate Caso Malasia\"        }    ]}"